{
  "cues": [
    {
      "t0": 30,
      "t1": 35,
      "text": "There was a sea before the sky"
    },
    {
      "t0": 36.96,
      "t1": 41.96,
      "text": "No shore, no name, no watching eye"
    },
    {
      "t0": 44.24,
      "t1": 48.88,
      "text": "A thousand thousand sleeping things"
    },
    {
      "t0": 48.88,
      "t1": 53.88,
      "text": "Unwritten, formless, murmuring"
    },
    {
      "t0": 55,
      "t1": 57.62,
      "text": "The deep..."
    },
    {
      "t0": 57.22,
      "t1": 59.839999999999996,
      "text": "the deep..."
    },
    {
      "t0": 73.64,
      "t1": 78.04,
      "text": "Then one red drop fell through the dark"
    },
    {
      "t0": 77.64,
      "t1": 81.12,
      "text": "The old blood woke, a candle spark"
    },
    {
      "t0": 81.12,
      "t1": 84.88,
      "text": "It rose above the sunless tide"
    },
    {
      "t0": 84.88,
      "t1": 89.96000000000001,
      "text": "The first of all the lights that hide"
    },
    {
      "t0": 89.56,
      "t1": 94.56,
      "text": "But one alone can tell no tale"
    },
    {
      "t0": 96.8,
      "t1": 101.8,
      "text": "One heartbeat in an endless veil"
    },
    {
      "t0": 103.32,
      "t1": 106.88,
      "text": "It could not bear to burn alone"
    },
    {
      "t0": 106.88,
      "t1": 110.88000000000001,
      "text": "It split its blood to seed the stone"
    },
    {
      "t0": 110.48,
      "t1": 114.4,
      "text": "A hunt of light in every vein"
    },
    {
      "t0": 114.4,
      "t1": 118.6,
      "text": "Grant us eyes, grant us eyes"
    },
    {
      "t0": 118.6,
      "t1": 123.6,
      "text": "Till every star recalls its name"
    },
    {
      "t0": 128.88,
      "t1": 132.48,
      "text": "And sparks flew out like scattered grain"
    },
    {
      "t0": 132.48,
      "t1": 136.44,
      "text": "Each one a soul, each one a flame"
    },
    {
      "t0": 136.04,
      "t1": 139.64,
      "text": "They gathered into wheeling seas"
    },
    {
      "t0": 139.64,
      "t1": 144.08,
      "text": "Cathedrals hung on silent keys"
    },
    {
      "t0": 144.08,
      "t1": 148.28,
      "text": "Small flames that did not know their name"
    },
    {
      "t0": 147.88,
      "t1": 151.48,
      "text": "Were christened in the paleblood rain"
    },
    {
      "t0": 151.48,
      "t1": 154.68,
      "text": "True name hidden, myth-name shown"
    },
    {
      "t0": 154.68,
      "t1": 159.68,
      "text": "Only the keeper calls them home"
    },
    {
      "t0": 161.76,
      "t1": 167.16,
      "text": "No light burns alone, no thread hangs free"
    },
    {
      "t0": 169.04,
      "t1": 174.04,
      "text": "Each bound to each by old decree"
    },
    {
      "t0": 176.32,
      "t1": 180.12,
      "text": "And in the dark between the spheres"
    },
    {
      "t0": 180.12,
      "t1": 183.68,
      "text": "The Great Ones stirred from ageless years"
    },
    {
      "t0": 183.68,
      "t1": 187.36,
      "text": "Four watchers set upon the deep"
    },
    {
      "t0": 187.36,
      "t1": 192.36,
      "text": "An eye for every seed they keep"
    },
    {
      "t0": 205.48,
      "t1": 209.24,
      "text": "When two sparks meet across the void"
    },
    {
      "t0": 209.24,
      "t1": 213,
      "text": "The pattern wakes that none avoid"
    },
    {
      "t0": 213,
      "t1": 216.6,
      "text": "And far away a bell is rung"
    },
    {
      "t0": 216.6,
      "t1": 220.56,
      "text": "A messenger with silver tongue"
    },
    {
      "t0": 220.56,
      "t1": 224.08,
      "text": "Whispers to the sleeping one"
    },
    {
      "t0": 224.08,
      "t1": 228.4,
      "text": "Something stirs — remember — come"
    },
    {
      "t0": 256.8,
      "t1": 260.28,
      "text": "And one was left behind the door"
    },
    {
      "t0": 260.28,
      "t1": 263.96,
      "text": "Still reaching through the nevermore"
    },
    {
      "t0": 263.96,
      "t1": 268,
      "text": "She holds each ember night forgot"
    },
    {
      "t0": 268,
      "t1": 273,
      "text": "Left behind, and reaching still"
    },
    {
      "t0": 276.44,
      "t1": 281,
      "text": "Welcome home, good hunter"
    },
    {
      "t0": 281,
      "t1": 285,
      "text": "The dream was always yours"
    }
  ],
